      source: "Photograph of Balkrishna Doshi at the Indian Institute of Architects National Convention held in Chennai in December 2013 (Commons description: 'held at Chennai Trade Centre'; a convention attendee's blog places the three-day convention at the Chennai Convention Center and records Doshi's keynote), taken by Sanyam Bahga on 27 December 2013 with a Nikon D60 (EXIF) and uploaded by him to Wikimedia Commons as his own work. The Commons file is a 825 x 1032 pixel crop of the 3872 x 2592 camera frame; used as is, re-encoded only, not resized and not upscaled.",
