      source: "Studio portrait of Komitas Vardapet in civilian dress captioned 'Komitas Vardapet, Berlin, August 3, 1896' on the photo gallery of the Komitas Museum-Institute, Yerevan (the holder's own 1625 x 2560 pixel file, the first of its two 1896 Berlin portraits); the same photograph is on Wikimedia Commons as 'Komitas01.jpg' (2362 x 3720) with the museum-institute named as source. Downscaled to 635 x 1000 with no upscaling and no other change.",
