      license: "Public domain: engraving published in London in 1835; the engraver Ryall died in 1867 and the painter Brooke in 1860, so any copyright expired long ago; Commons records it as PD-old-100 with the CC Public Domain Mark in the National Library of Wales / Wikimedia UK collaboration, a release by the holder. Not the NPG or Amgueddfa Cymru photograph of the painting, which are claimed or permission-only reproductions and were not used.",
      width: 630,
      height: 690,
      licenseUrl: "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/",
